OL,3,GNEWSAVigil held for 21-year-old man    
OL,4,Astabbed to death                       
OL,6,FFamily and friends of a 21-year-old man
OL,7,Fwho was stabbed to death in north      
OL,8,FLondon have gathered at a vigil in his 
OL,9,Fmemory.                                
OL,11,FThomas Oduro, from Tottenham, was      
OL,12,Fattacked in Lordship Lane, Haringey,   
OL,13,Fshortly after 18:00 GMT on 13 November 
OL,14,Fand died at the scene.                 
OL,16,FA 30-year-old man has been arrested in 
OL,17,FDublin in connection with the incident,
OL,18,Fand extradition proceedings are due to 
OL,19,Ftake place next month.                 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
