OL,3,GNEWSAVigil held for 21-year-old man    
OL,4,Astabbed to death                       
OL,6,FSpeaking after the vigil on Friday     
OL,7,Fevening, Oduro's cousin Denzel told BBC
OL,8,FLondon: "As a family we're heartbroken.
OL,9,FThomas was special."                   
